<BaseLayout
  title="About Us - LEEYOUNG"
  description="Learn about LEEYOUNG's history, vision, and commitment to quality in manufacturing industrial equipment."
>
  <Header />

  <!-- Hero Section with 3D Globe -->
  <section class="about-hero">
    <div class="hero-globe-container">
      <div class="globe-wrapper">
        <Globe3D client:only="react" />
      </div>
      <div class="hero-overlay">
        <div class="hero-content">
          <h2 class="hero-subheading">Our Story</h2>
          <h1 class="hero-title">Global Manufacturing Excellence</h1>
          <p class="hero-text">
            Jinhua Leeyoung Hardware Manufacture Co., Ltd is located in Wucheng District, Jinhua — <strong>330 km from Shanghai, 170 km from Hangzhou, and 50 km from Yiwu Airport</strong>.
          </p>
          <p class="hero-text">
            With ISO certification and BSCI, VPA, and GS-TUV compliance, we deliver quality products to global markets across Europe, Americas, Asia-Pacific, and beyond.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Image with Text Section 1 -->
  <section class="image-text-section bg-light">
    <div class="section-container">
      <div class="image-text-grid slide-in-left">
        <div class="image-column">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1504328345606-18bbc8c9d7d1?w=800&h=600&fit=crop"
            alt="LEEYOUNG Manufacturing"
            class="section-image"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="text-column">
          <div class="text-content">
            <h3 class="section-subheading">Our Facilities</h3>
            <h2 class="section-title">World-Class Manufacturing</h2>
            <p>
              We operate <strong>two state-of-the-art factories</strong>: Factory No.1 covers 18,000m² with 10,000m² production area, and Factory No.2 spans 28,000m² with 18,000m² production area. Together, our <strong>46,000m² total area</strong> supports an annual output of <strong>600,000 pieces</strong>.
            </p>
            <p>
              Our facilities are equipped with automatic packing assembly lines that significantly enhance efficiency and quality. With ISO system adoption and certification from BSCI, VPA, and GS-TUV, <strong>90% of our products obtain international certification</strong>.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Image with Text Section 2 -->
  <section class="image-text-section bg-gray">
    <div class="section-container">
      <div class="image-text-grid reverse slide-in-right">
        <div class="image-column">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1581091226825-a6a2a5aee158?w=800&h=600&fit=crop"
            alt="Quality Control"
            class="section-image"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="text-column">
          <div class="text-content">
            <h3 class="section-subheading">Our Expertise</h3>
            <h2 class="section-title">Specialized Manufacturing</h2>
            <p>
              <strong>LEEYOUNG specializes in manufacturing trolleys, hand trucks, rubber wheels and plastic wheels.</strong>
              Our product range serves diverse industries worldwide, with main markets spanning Europe, South America, North America, Mexico, Japan, Australia, New Zealand, Korea, Taiwan, and Hong Kong.
            </p>
            <p>
              We choose materials with care and engineer each product as a balanced system—combining reliable components, robust construction, and performance-driven design. Our automatic packing assembly lines ensure consistent quality at scale. <strong>We build equipment for real work.</strong>
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Image with Text Section 3 -->
  <section class="image-text-section bg-light">
    <div class="section-container">
      <div class="image-text-grid slide-in-left">
        <div class="image-column">
          <img
            src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1487058792275-0ad4aaf24ca7?w=800&h=600&fit=crop"
            alt="Innovation"
            class="section-image"
          />
        </div>
        <div class="text-column">
          <div class="text-content">
            <h3 class="section-subheading">Innovation</h3>
            <h2 class="section-title">Expert R&D Team</h2>
            <p>
              Our own R&D team is expert in designing products tailored to different demands and applications.
              This capability is one of the key factors that has guaranteed our sales growth rate year after year.
            </p>
            <p>
              Innovation isn't just about new features—it's about creating practical solutions that meet real-world challenges.
              Every design is refined through testing and customer feedback, ensuring our products deliver genuine value in demanding environments.
            </p>
          </div>
